[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0146","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0146.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"泛微 E-cology 9 前台 SQL 注入漏洞","description":"泛微 E-cology 9 的 /mobile/browser/WorkflowCenterTreeData.jsp 接口存在前台 SQL 注入漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向该接口发送特制 POST 请求，在 node 或 scope 参数中注入恶意 SQL 语句，成功利用后可窃取数据库中的敏感信息，包括管理员账号密码及系统配置数据，严重威胁系统安全。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2025-0203a31d"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-07-17T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-07-17T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即联系泛微官方获取最新安全补丁包，升级 E-cology 9 系统至最新修复版本。若暂时无法升级，在 WAF 或反向代理层配置规则拦截对 /mobile/browser/WorkflowCenterTreeData.jsp 的请求中 node 和 scope 参数的恶意 SQL 语句，并对该接口实施严格的输入参数校验，禁止拼接用户输入到 SQL 查询中。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0146.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0016","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0016.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-30762","title":"Oracle WebLogic Server Core 认证机制缺失漏洞","description":"Oracle WebLogic Server Core 组件存在关键功能认证机制缺失漏洞（CWE-306），未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过 T3、IIOP 协议向目标服务器发送特制请求，绕过身份验证机制，成功利用后可未授权访问服务器中的敏感数据，甚至获取全部可访问数据的完全访问权限。该漏洞影响 WebLogic Server 12.2.1.4.0、14.1.1.0.0 及 14.1.2.0.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Oracle 官方已发布安全补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-30762"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-07-15T20:15:30Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:09:18Z","remediation":"立即从 My Oracle Support 下载并安装 Oracle 2025 年 7 月关键补丁更新 (CPUJul2025)，为 WebLogic Server 12.2.1.4.0/14.1.1.0.0/14.1.2.0.0 应用对应补丁。如无法立即更新，可在 WebLogic 管理控制台禁用 T3 和 IIOP 协议，或在网络层面限制对 7001/7002 端口的未授权访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpujul2025.html","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-30762"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0016.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0256","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0256.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"龙采商城系统 auditing 接口 SQL 注入漏洞","description":"龙采商城系统 /coupon/auditing 接口未对用户输入的 id 参数进行有效过滤和转义，攻击者可在未经认证的情况下通过 POST 请求向该接口注入恶意 SQL 语句，利用 updatexml 函数实现报错注入，从而获取数据库中的敏感信息（如数据库版本、用户凭证等）。该漏洞危害较大，可能导致商户数据泄露及后台系统被进一步渗透，建议立即对输入参数实施参数化查询。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2025-0469aa7e"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-07-14T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-07-14T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级龙采商城系统至官方最新版本，修复 auditing 接口未对 id 参数进行过滤导致的 SQL 注入漏洞。如暂无法升级，在 WAF 或应用防火墙中配置规则，拦截包含 updatexml、extractvalue 等报错注入关键字的请求，并对 id 参数实施严格的数字类型校验，禁用字符串拼接方式构造 SQL 语句。建议开发团队对所有用户输入参数进行白名单过滤和转义处理，代码层改用参数化查询或预编译语句。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0256.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0617","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0617.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1735","title":"PHP pgsql扩展 SQL注入漏洞","description":"PHP 的 pgsql 和 pdo_pgsql 扩展在调用底层引用函数对 SQL 字符串进行转义处理时，未对函数返回值进行错误检查。当转义函数因 PostgreSQL 服务器拒绝无效字符串而返回错误时，程序未正确处理该错误状态，可能导致应用程序发生崩溃。该漏洞影响 PHP 8.1.x（低于 8.1.33）、8.2.x（低于 8.2.29）、8.3.x（低于 8.3.23）以及 8.4.x 版本中使用 pgsql 或 pdo_pgsql 扩展的应用。攻击条件为：远程攻击者能够控制传入转义函数的 SQL 查询字符串内容，且 PostgreSQL 服务器因该字符串格式无效而拒绝接受。成功利用可导致应用程序拒绝服务，但不会直接造成数据泄露或权限提升。建议升级至 PHP 8.1.33、8.2.29、8.3.23 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1735"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-07-13T23:15:22Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:39:41Z","remediation":"立即升级 PHP 至以下安全版本：PHP 8.1.33、8.2.29、8.3.23 或 8.4.11 及以上版本，修复 pgsql 与 pdo_pgsql 扩展在字符串转义时未检查底层 quoting 函数返回值的问题。对于使用操作系统包管理的系统，可通过 apt install php8.1-pgsql 或 yum update php-pgsql 安装对应安全补丁。如无法立即升级，应避免将未经严格校验的用户输入直接传入 pg_escape_string() 或 PDO::quote() 等转义函数，并在 PostgreSQL 服务端启用严格的字符串格式校验，以降低因服务器拒绝无效字符串导致 PHP 进程崩溃的风险。同时审查所有使用 pgsql/pdo_pgsql 扩展的代码路径，确保异常情况下不会触发未处理的段错误。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/php/php-src/security/advisories/GHSA-hrwm-9436-5mv3","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/07/11/4","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/07/msg00017.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-1735.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c5e4706a6f93aee327d22a13e10aa3342dbdb394/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1735.json","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/5fdf2422146ec927f5e2b344eb0d3699de2a8ba3/doc/2025-07/PHP 漏洞 CVE-2025-1735（SQLi∕崩溃）.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/74ccdf810d46bdbdefa13be5d1e35ae034798324/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1735.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/aba6897d631ff42fcc032e2f13044e7ab4f4b566/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-1735.json","https://github.com/centminmod/centminmod/blob/4b09ee7ab641598515138e70a98fbc69cf5a8eef/patches/php/php80-cve-2025-1735.patch","https://github.com/centminmod/centminmod/blob/4b09ee7ab641598515138e70a98fbc69cf5a8eef/patches/php/php742-cve-2025-1735.patch","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/0c8dd71e3ecd7211889d43b088995c7a1a3f2c10/data/2025/CVE-2025-1735.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-1735.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/27a74eedb9de5512b284a88a513f48696206fede/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-1735.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0617.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0506","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0506.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-1220","title":"PHP 主机名空字节终止验证绕过漏洞","description":"PHP 8.1.33、8.2.29、8.3.23、8.4.10 之前版本中，fsockopen() 等函数未对主机名中的空字节进行校验。攻击者可构造包含空字节的主机名字符串，使 parse_url() 等函数对主机名的解析结果与 fsockopen() 实际连接的目标不一致，从而绕过基于主机名的访问控制检查。该漏洞利用条件较高（需攻击者能控制主机名输入且存在访问控制逻辑），CVSS 评分 3.7，危害等级低，但可能导致 SSRF 或访问控制绕过等安全问题。","severity":"LOW","score":3.7,"aliases":["CVE-2025-1220"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-07-13T23:15:22Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:38:37Z","remediation":"升级 PHP 至 8.1.33、8.2.29、8.3.23 或 8.4.10 及以上版本，这些版本已修复 fsockopen() 等函数对主机名中空字节的校验缺失问题。如无法立即升级，可在应用层对用户输入的主机名进行空字节过滤（如过滤 \\0 字符），并避免在访问控制检查后使用 parse_url() 等函数处理未经验证的主机名。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/php/php-src/security/advisories/GHSA-3cr5-j632-f35r","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/07/11/4","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/07/msg00017.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-1220.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1220.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/95f29039d9df9f64ea752bc1ef04de2ad5981e05/2025/1xxx/CVE-2025-1220.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-12208.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-12207.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-12203.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-12206.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-12202.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-12200.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-12209.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0506.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0506.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0039","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0039.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-7523","title":"金和 OA C6 DelTemp.aspx XML外部实体注入致任意文件读取漏洞","description":"金和协同管理平台 C6 版本的 DelTemp.aspx 页面存在 XML 外部实体注入（XXE）漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 XML 请求，利用外部实体引用机制读取服务器上的任意敏感文件（如配置文件、系统文件等），导致信息泄露。该漏洞影响金和 OA C6 系列版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。目前漏洞利用细节已公开，建议用户及时升级或采取访问控制措施。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-7523"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-07-13T07:15:22Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:05:08Z","remediation":"立即联系金和厂商获取 C6 安全补丁包；临时缓解措施：在应用服务器 XML 解析器中禁用外部实体解析（设置 libxml_disable_entity_loader(true) 或禁用 DTD），在 WAF 层拦截 POST 请求中包含 `<!ENTITY`、`<!DOCTYPE` 等 XXE 特征 payload 的请求，并对 `/c6/Jhsoft.Web.message/ToolBar/DelTemp.aspx` 路径实施 IP 白名单访问控制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/BigMancer/Jinhe-OA-XXE-Vulnerability","https://github.com/BigMancer/Jinhe-OA-XXE-Vulnerability?tab=readme-ov-file#proof-of-concept","https://vuldb.com/?ctiid.316220","https://vuldb.com/?id.316220","https://vuldb.com/?submit.611183","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-7523.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/24df5d59670dfe04b9c86de11fa86df63c0d28f7/cves/2025/7xxx/CVE-2025-7523.json","https://github.com/SourByte05/Vulnerability-Wiki-PoC/blob/e52a2c3eaf2fb0befc721cf0919d07ea435a23b4/2025/%E9%87%91%E5%92%8CC6%20DelTemp.aspx%20XML%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5%E8%87%B4%E4%BB%BB%E6%84%8F%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%96%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2025-7523)/%E9%87%91%E5%92%8CC6%20DelTemp.aspx%20XML%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5%E8%87%B4%E4%BB%BB%E6%84%8F%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%96%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2025-7523).md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6ce62c4fb53e185987a087a07544538a62587799/2025/7xxx/CVE-2025-7523.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/0d273a0b2821f58c8dfa9e9b4a2ad049f300e8ec/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-7523.md","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/type/xxe.txt","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2025-7523.html","https://github.com/damn77789/nuclei-pocs/blob/81fb60243f8c8e930e9c4f1b65e2110e6e5a9204/folder-6/poc-yaml-jinher-deltemp-aspx-xxe-cve-2025-7523.yaml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/4544d3857250fe21711ce8febf38e8822729678f/advisories/unreviewed/2025/07/GHSA-qh6p-rhwf-c956/GHSA-qh6p-rhwf-c956.json","https://github.com/8irdy/wiki_poc/blob/9c0ae2f6d619bb358f3db31aef3970dd5a0be7f8/2025HW_Vulnerability/%E9%87%91%E5%92%8CC6_DelTemp.aspx_XML%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5%E8%87%B4%E4%BB%BB%E6%84%8F%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E8%AF%BB%E5%8F%96%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2025-7523).md","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-7523"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0039.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0339","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0339.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"南昊网上阅卷系统 monitor 组件未授权访问漏洞","description":"南昊网上阅卷系统的 monitor 组件存在未授权访问漏洞，攻击者无需身份认证即可直接访问系统后台敏感接口，获取阅卷数据、考生信息等核心资源。该漏洞源于系统对 monitor 路径下的请求缺乏有效的权限校验机制，攻击者只需构造特定 HTTP 请求即可利用，危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2025-05d3b196"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-07-12T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-07-12T00:00:00Z","remediation":"为南昊网上阅卷系统 monitor 路径配置身份认证，在反向代理层添加 Basic Auth 或集成 LDAP 认证机制，同时设置源 IP 白名单仅允许管理网段访问；联系厂商获取安全更新版本并升级，如暂时无法升级则通过防火墙限制对 monitor 组件的访问端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0339.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0136","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0136.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"东胜物流系统 SoftMng 任意文件上传漏洞","description":"东胜物流系统 `/SoftMng/FileInputHandler/Upload` 接口存在任意文件上传漏洞，攻击者可在未经身份认证的情况下，通过构造特制的 multipart/form-data 请求向服务器上传恶意文件（如 WebShell），进而获取服务器控制权，实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响东胜物流系统多个版本，危害等级高，建议厂商及时修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["HWPOC-2025-01e693fd"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-07-11T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-07-11T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即联系东胜物流厂商获取最新安全补丁，升级至修复该漏洞的版本。临时缓解措施：在 Web 服务器（如 Nginx/Apache）中限制 `/SoftMng/FileInputHandler/Upload` 及 `/MsWlTruck/CertUpload` 接口仅允许上传图片等白名单扩展名，禁止上传目录的脚本执行权限，并在应用层增加文件内容类型校验，避免直接保存可执行脚本文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/xinsang923/dswl"],"poc_urls":["https://github.com/xinsang923/dswl"],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0136.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0046","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0046.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"金和OA TaskReportConfirm.aspx SQL注入漏洞","description":"金和OA（协同管理平台）的 TaskReportConfirm.aspx 接口存在 SQL 注入漏洞。攻击者可在未授权的情况下向该接口传递特制的恶意参数，拼接执行任意 SQL 语句，进而窃取数据库中的敏感数据（如用户凭证、系统配置），甚至可能通过写 WebShell 等方式获取服务器控制权。该漏洞利用难度低，无需复杂权限认证，对部署了相关版本金和OA的企业内网构成严重威胁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2025-000f81e9"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-07-10T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-07-10T00:00:00Z","remediation":"联系金和网络官方获取安全补丁，升级至修复此漏洞的最新版本。临时措施：在 IIS 中添加 URL 重写规则，对 TaskReportConfirm.aspx 的传入参数进行严格过滤，拦截 select/union/insert 等 SQL 关键字；部署 WAF 规则防御 SQL 注入攻击。代码层面应改用参数化查询替代字符串拼接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0046.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0038","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0038.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-53645","title":"Zimbra Collaboration Suite 管理控制台远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Zimbra Collaboration Suite (ZCS) 的管理控制台在处理包含大量逗号分隔路径段的 GET 请求时存在不当处理漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可向目标系统发送特制请求，触发冗余处理并生成膨胀的响应，导致目标系统资源被过度消耗，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 ZCS 9.0.0 Patch 46 之前版本、10.0.15 之前版本及 10.1.9 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-53645"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-07-09T17:15:31Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:38:37Z","remediation":"升级 Zimbra Collaboration Suite 至 9.0.0 Patch 46、10.0.15 或 10.1.9 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面限制对 Admin Console 路径的 GET 请求长度，过滤包含过多逗号分隔路径段的请求以缓解资源消耗。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wiki.zimbra.com/wiki/Security_Center","https://wiki.zimbra.com/wiki/Zimbra_Releases/10.0.15#Security_Fixes","https://wiki.zimbra.com/wiki/Zimbra_Releases/10.1.9#Security_Fixes","https://wiki.zimbra.com/wiki/Zimbra_Releases/9.0.0/P46#Security_Fixes","https://wiki.zimbra.com/wiki/Zimbra_Responsible_Disclosure_Policy","https://wiki.zimbra.com/wiki/Zimbra_Security_Advisories","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/30c3a896d257362f7419b0c772be2f3dd063ccaa/cves/2025/53xxx/CVE-2025-53645.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/7614318c7ea4c24f707447d3fff16042945e6e08/2025/53xxx/CVE-2025-53645.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-2025-53645.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/7f9d328c5fbc6b96e5e86ea6c9dab85e4e384533/docs/2025/zimbra_zimbracollaboration-suite-%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E-cve-2025-53645.toml","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2025-53645.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2025/07/GHSA-92rg-2wcj-32jv/GHSA-92rg-2wcj-32jv.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d0a8c476da89b37a2bbb6193b7964b10d03aff75/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-53645.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/d2db0569df181d5506cd0b443d26007c2bff1c8a/CVEs_log/2025-07-10_en.md","https://github.com/f-peng/f-peng.github.io/blob/52c86425bdabc6f3e13c98ca5b296519f6f5fa9e/content/cyber/blog_2025-07-10.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-53645.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-53645"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0038.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0317","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0317.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"用友NC getFormltem doPost SQL注入漏洞","description":"用友 NC 系统 getFormltem 接口的 doPost 方法存在 SQL 注入漏洞，由于未对用户输入参数进行充分过滤和转义，远程攻击者可在未授权情况下发送特制的 HTTP POST 请求，注入恶意 SQL 语句实现对后台数据库的查询、修改或删除，导致敏感数据泄露或服务器被控。该漏洞影响用友 NC 多个版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2025-05769498"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-07-09T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-07-09T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级用友 NC 至官方发布的最新安全补丁版本，NC6.5 及以上系列请更新至 2025 年安全补丁包。若无法立即升级，在 Web 应用防火墙或反向代理层配置规则拦截对 /service/~iufo/nc.bs.pf.xx.getFormltem 路径的 POST 请求，对请求参数中包含 SQL 关键字（如 SELECT、UNION、DROP 等）的流量进行拦截，并限制该接口仅允许可信内网 IP 地址访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0317.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0270","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0270.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"大华 智能物联综合管理平台 GetClassValue 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"浙江大华技术股份有限公司智能物联综合管理平台（ICC）的 GetClassValue 接口存在远程命令执行漏洞。由于该接口未对用户传入的类名与参数进行有效校验和过滤，未授权攻击者可构造恶意请求调用任意 Java 类方法，进而在服务器上执行任意系统命令，最终导致服务器被完全控制、敏感数据泄露及内网横向渗透。该漏洞无需认证即可利用，PoC 已公开并存在在野利用，危害极大。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["HWPOC-2025-04a7106a"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-07-09T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-07-09T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议尽快联系大华技术支持获取智能物联综合管理平台（ICC）的最新安全补丁并升级到官方修复版本。若无法立即升级，可通过在边界防火墙或反向代理上限制对 GetClassValue 接口的外部访问、关闭管理平台对公网暴露的端口、部署 WAF 拦截异常调用请求等方式进行临时缓解，并排查是否已存在被入侵痕迹。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.dahuatech.com/"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0270.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0027","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0027.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-47981","title":"Microsoft Windows SPNEGO Extended Negotiation (NEGOEX) 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows SPNEGO Extended Negotiation (NEGOEX) 安全机制存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制协商请求触发该漏洞，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击者无需用户交互即可利用，建议用户尽快安装安全更新修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-47981"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-07-08T17:15:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:28:56Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 7 月安全更新。受影响版本对应修复版本：Windows 10 1507 ≥ 10.0.10240.21073、Windows 10 1607/Server 2016 ≥ 10.0.14393.8246、Windows 10 1809/Server 2019 ≥ 10.0.17763.7558、Windows 10 21H2 ≥ 10.0.19044.6093、Windows 10 22H2 ≥ 10.0.19045.6093、Windows 11 22H2 ≥ 10.0.22621.5624、Windows 11 23H2 ≥ 10.0.22631.5624、Windows 11 24H2/Server 2025 ≥ 10.0.26100.4652、Server 2022 ≥ 10.0.20348.3932。如无法立即打补丁，可通过注册表禁用 SPNEGO NEGOEX 机制作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-47981","https://www.vicarius.io/vsociety/posts/cve-2025-47981-detection-script-heap-based-buffer-overflow-in-windows-spnego-extended-negotiation","https://www.vicarius.io/vsociety/posts/cve-2025-47981-mitigation-script-heap-based-buffer-overflow-in-windows-spnego-extended-negotiation","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-47981.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/3f7b36031f03dbbe570abbcfed8c4b66874bb4dc/2025/CVE-2025-47981.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/a7fcebc1b9e9a88d443be844dae279be54e22ef4/data/2025/CVE-2025-47981-barbaraogmgf_CVE-2025-47981-POC.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/aaa966adf56b88bf2eba7f47ee24a777c6208719/2025/CVE-2025-47981/README.md","https://github.com/4ESTSEC/wxvl/blob/26b15b25c2543f872c330110db4ab2967c7c33e0/doc/2025-07/%E3%80%90%E9%A6%96%E5%8F%91%E5%A4%8D%E7%8E%B0%E3%80%91Windows%20NEGOEX%20%E8%A0%95%E8%99%AB%E7%BA%A7%E9%AB%98%E5%8D%B1%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2025-47981).md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d00c4bdddf18e05c46df568e8ae91e7912ce321c/cves/2025/47xxx/CVE-2025-47981.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-47981","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/8854c056beab250ba690e2bcc8887feb4c1f8139/2025/CVE-2025-47981/poc.py","https://github.com/DefectDojo/django-DefectDojo/blob/d9905eb7656178d3e59e0bf8f1d53a9ee9e50186/unittests/scans/openvas/report_detail_v2.csv","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/333a12945888842887b9d7f35a124feef86df7c3/docs/2025/%E5%BE%AE%E8%BD%AF_windows-%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E-cve-2025-47981.toml","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-47981"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0027.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0656","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0656.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21195","title":"Microsoft Azure Service Fabric 运行时权限提升漏洞","description":"Azure Service Fabric 运行时存在不安全的链接解析漏洞（CWE-59，链接跟随）。已获得授权的本地攻击者可通过创建恶意符号链接，诱导 Service Fabric 运行时在处理文件访问时错误地解析链接路径，从而实现对目标系统上文件的高完整性篡改或敏感信息删除。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高，需要低权限用户交互配合，影响 Azure Service Fabric 运行时的文件访问机制。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 7 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21195"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-07-08T17:15:33Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:44Z","remediation":"立即将 Azure Service Fabric 运行时升级至 10.1 Cumulative Update 7.0 或更高版本。可通过 Microsoft Update Catalog 或 Windows Update 获取该安全更新。临时缓解措施：限制对 Service Fabric 节点的本地交互式登录权限，仅允许受信任的管理员账户访问，以降低本地提权攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21195","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-21195.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/03dbfc069b6c638678ff904c80e89aaf72b93764/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21195.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21195.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21195.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2d66b7c0b89f8bfe02ef8d342b4bf0a1bab5ffd1/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21195.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21195.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21195.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-211xx/CVE-2025-21195.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21195.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0913c49bc4f4fd607e8625f162967246063e1d20/2025/CVE-2025-21195.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0656.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0210","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0210.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"金和 OA-C6 系统 ActionDataSet 接口 XML 外部实体注入漏洞","description":"金和OA-C6系统的ActionDataSet接口存在XML外部实体注入（XXE）漏洞。攻击者可通过向/jc6/servlet/ActionDataSet接口发送特制的XML请求包，利用服务器端XML解析器对外部实体的处理缺陷，实现任意文件读取、内网探测或SSRF攻击。该漏洞影响金和OA-C6系统，无需身份认证即可远程利用，危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2025-03271f79"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-07-08T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-07-08T00:00:00Z","remediation":"联系金和厂商获取 C6 系统最新安全补丁，或升级至官方修复版本。如无法立即升级，修改 Tomcat 下 /jc6/WEB-INF/web.xml 中 ActionDataSet 相关 XML 解析器配置，禁止外部实体解析（关闭 DocumentBuilderFactory 的 expandEntityReferences 和 external-general-entities 特性）；同时部署 WAF 规则拦截含 <!ENTITY 和 <!DOCTYPE 的外部实体声明请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0210.toml"}]